<title>INDIA: India SAIL 1996/97 net seen down 33 pct.</title>
<headline>India SAIL 1996/97 net seen down 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit State-run Steel Authority of India Ltd (SAIL) is projected to fall 33.22 percent to 8.87 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, as per a consensus of 28 leading securities and brokerage firms polled by Reuters.</p>
<p>The forecasts ranged from 6.23 billion rupees to 13.26 billion rupees against 13.29 billion rupees a year ago.</p>
<p>SAIL is India's largest steel maker.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>SAIL   ----PAT seen down 33.22%, sales off 6.68%</p>
